#org @gText_Pallet_GaryWantKanto
[GREEN][RIVAL]: [BLUE] Hey gramps! I thought I\nasked for a Kanto starter!\p[GREEN]Oak: [BLUE]Fine, fine.\nYou can have this last one I still\lhave leftover.

#org @gText_PalletGary_WayCooler
[GREEN][RIVAL]: [BLUE]Heh!\n[GREEN][BUFFER1][BLUE] looks way cooler\lthan this piece of garbage! 

#org @gText_TimeChangerAide_1
[BLUE]Hey [GREEN][PLAYER]!\p[BLUE]I've been working on a prototype\nfor a time changer device.\pSurely, you could find this useful.\pI could teach it to you if\nyou can handle some trivia.\pYou want to give it a go?

#org @gText_TimeChangerAide_2
[BLUE]Okay, let's get started.\pWhich of these do not have\na night specific evolution?

#org @gText_TimeChangerPancham
Pancham

#org @gText_TimeChangerAurora
Amaura

#org @gText_TimeChangerEevee
Eevee

#org @gText_TimeChangercubone
Cubone

#org @gText_TimeChangerAide_NotCorrect
Oof, that doesn't seem to be correct.

#org @gText_TimeChangerAide_3
What time do night-time encounters\nstart?

#org @gText_TimeChanger5PM
5 PM

#org @gText_TimeChanger8PM
8 PM

#org @gText_TimeChanger11PM
11 PM

#org @gText_TimeChangerAide_Correct
Correct! Next one[.]

#org @gText_TimeChangerAide_CorrectFinal
Nice, that's right! Final question[.]

#org @gText_TimeChangerAide_4
When is the final version of Radical\nRed coming out?

#org @gText_TimeChangerAide_2023
2023

#org @gText_TimeChangerAide_2030
2030

#org @gText_TimeChangerAide_Never
Never

#org @gText_TimeChangerAide_5
I guess you don't miss! Alright,\nhere you go.

#org @gText_TimeChanger_Unlock
[BLACK]You unlocked the Time Changer!

#org @gText_TimeChangerAide_6
To use the Time Changer, press [L_BUTTON]\nto bring up your skills.\pUse it, and choose a time of\nday to change to.\pNote that you'll be stuck in\nthat time of day until you\lclick the Reset option or change\lto another time of day.

#org @gText_PalletTown_OakFight1
Well, [GREEN][PLAYER][BLUE], I knew you had\na lot in you, but I never would\lhave guessed you'd become Champ!\pNot this quick!\pWell, I'm nowhere as strong as I was\nin my prime, but I could cause you\lsome trouble.\pI've got a new item I've been\nworking on that I'd like to test.\pHow about it?

#org @gText_PalletTown_OakFight2
Alright, let's see if these old\nbones still got it!

#org @gText_PalletTown_OakScared
Scared of this old timer?\nWahahaha!

#org @gText_PalletTown_OakWarmup
Hm, that was just a warm up.

#org @gText_PalletTown_OakStillGot
Huh, you thought we were done?\nThis old man still has more left\lin him!

#org @gText_PalletTown_LossForReal
Okay, okay.\nYou got me.

#org @gText_PalletTown_OakFight3
Heh, sorry to cheat like that,\n[GREEN][PLAYER].\p[BLUE]I knew I had to throw everything\nand the kitchen sink at you to\lstand a chance.\pHere, have the item I've been\nworking on.\pThe Eevium Z normally only works\non Eevee, but I've polished it to\lwork on its evolutions as well.\pAlthough on Eevee, it gives +2 to all\nstats, it only gives +2 to\loffensive stats on the Eeveelutions.\pYou need Last Resort to proc this.\pStill not a bad item at all!\pAll yours!

#org @gText_PalletTown_OakFight4
Well, get back at it, [GREEN][PLAYER].\p[BLUE]I'm sure [GREEN][RIVAL][BLUE] is still\ntraining to become stronger, so\ldon't fall behind.


#org @gText_PalletTown_AideStop1
[BLUE]Hey [GREEN][PLAYER]!\pStarting on your journey eh?\nMust be exciting!\pAnyway, the professor told me not to\nlet any newbies through here.\pSorry about that!

#org @gText_PalletTown_AideStop2
[BLUE]Hey [GREEN][PLAYER],[BLUE] I can't let you\nthrough here just yet.

#org @gText_PalletTown_AideBattle1
[BLUE]Ah, I see you've got yourself\na Pok\edex from the professor.\pI suppose I could let you through\nnow, although you'd have to prove\lit to me in a battle.

#org @gText_PalletTown_NeedMoreThan1
[BLUE][.]I'm warning you, you might\nneed more than 1 Pok\emon to\ldefeat me[.]

#org @gText_PalletTown_AideBattle2
[BLUE]How about it?

#org @gText_Pallet_ProfAideDefeat
You've got potential!

#org @gText_PalletProfAideBattle3
[BLUE]Heh, thanks for entertaining me\n[GREEN][PLAYER].\pHere's a parting gift from\nme.

#org @gText_PalletProfAideBattle4
Well, Route 21's all yours!\pSee you around [GREEN][PLAYER].[BLUE]

#org @gText_Pallet_ProfDoneText
Icy Wind is a decent early game\ntool, and it hits both targets\lin doubles.

#org @gText_PalletProfAideRejected
Well, Route 21 has some Pok\emon\nyou won't find elsewhere.\pI wouldn't miss out on it.

#org @gText_Pallet_Stufful
[BLACK]Stufful!

#org @gText_Pallet_LassStuff1
[GREEN]Stufful[.]\n[RED]Do you really have to lay down\lhere of all places?\pWe're blocking the way to Route 21!

#org @gText_Pallet_LassStuff2
[RED]I'm so sorry, my [GREEN]Stufful\n[RED]has been in a mood lately[.]\pWe'll be out of your way soon.
